📜 Vaystrap Server Rules 📜
Welcome to the official Vaystrap Discord server! To ensure a safe, friendly, and organized environment for everyone, we enforce a strict set of rules. By participating in this server, you agree to follow these guidelines. Ignorance of the rules is not an excuse. 👇

---

🤝 1. Respect & Harassment
Treat all members with respect. We have zero tolerance for bullying, harassment, doxxing, or personal attacks.
Do not insult, flame, or antagonize other users.
If someone asks you to stop a certain behavior or topic, respect their boundaries.
Do not DM users without their permission, especially if it's to harass or spam them.

🚫 2. Hate Speech & Discrimination
Any form of hate speech is strictly prohibited. This includes racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, xenophobia, or any derogatory language aimed at a specific race, religion, gender, or sexual orientation. Using slurs or promoting hate groups will result in an immediate permanent ban.

💬 3. Spamming & Flooding
Do not spam the chat. This makes the server unreadable and ruins the experience for others.
No repetitive messages, wall of text, or excessive emojis.
No mass mentioning users or roles (@everyone, @here, pinging staff for no reason).
Do not use external auto-typers or spam bots in the general chat.

🔞 4. NSFW & Inappropriate Content
This is a strictly Safe-For-Work (SFW) server.
Do not post explicit, gore, sexual, or otherwise disturbing content.
This includes profile pictures, banners, usernames, and status messages.
If you wouldn't show it to a teacher or your boss, don't post it here.

📢 5. Advertising & Self-Promotion
Do not use this server to advertise your own stuff.
No posting links to other Discord servers, YouTube channels, TikToks, or paid services without explicit permission from the Staff.
Do not DM advertise. If someone reports you for DM advertising, you will be banned.

🦠 6. Malicious Content & Security
Do not share viruses, malware, IP loggers, token grabbers, or any malicious software.
Do not post fake download links for Vaystrap. Only use the official channels.
Do not attempt to hack, DDoS, or socially engineer other members or staff.

🎭 7. Impersonation
Do not impersonate Staff Members, Developers, or other users.
This includes using their profile pictures, copying their usernames, or claiming to have permissions you do not possess.
If you are caught impersonating staff to scam or threaten users, you will be permanently banned.

🗂️ 8. Channel Usage & On-Topic
Please keep conversations in their appropriate channels.
#general is for casual talk. Keep technical support in #support.
Do not derail support tickets or important announcements with memes.
Use the correct language channels if you are not speaking English in general.

⚖️ 9. Moderation & Staff Decisions
Our staff team is here to help, but their decisions must be respected.
Do not argue with moderators in public channels. If you disagree with a punishment, open a ticket.
Do not backseat moderate. If someone is breaking the rules, tag a moderator or use the report feature.

📑 10. Discord Terms of Service
You must follow the Discord Terms of Service and Community Guidelines at all times.
You must be 13 years or older to use Discord.
Do not share stolen accounts, cracked software, or illegal content.
⚠️ Punishment System
Depending on the severity of the offense, punishments will be applied as follows:
Warning / Mute: For minor offenses like spamming or minor toxicity.
Kick: Repeating minor offenses after being warned.
Temporary Ban: Severe toxicity, repeated rule breaking, or sharing malicious links.
Permanent Ban: Hate speech, NSFW content, DM advertising, or attempting to hack/steal accounts.

🛡️ Note: Staff members reserve the right to punish users at their own discretion for behavior that is deemed toxic or harmful to the community, even if it is not explicitly listed in these rules.

If you see anyone breaking these rules, please report them to a @Server Moderation or open a support ticket. Thank you for keeping Vaystrap safe! ❤️
